{"ID":"20240205153737-sj2exkj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153737-sj2exkj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153737-sj2exkj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206113401-zwz57b7\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185308-sz71qyh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619185308-sz71qyh\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"沉香","type":"doc","updated":"20240902095643"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240715175621-5981qc2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240715175621-5981qc2","updated":"20240715175624"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"土沉香"}]},{"ID":"20240206113401-zwz57b7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113401-zwz57b7","updated":"20240206113409"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广州、海南、广西。福建、台湾等地。\n【性状】\t该品为不规则的块状、片状或盔帽状，有的为小碎块。质较坚实。气芳香，苦味。燃烧时有浓烈的香气，并有黑色油状物渗出。\n【性味】\t辛、苦，微温。\n【功效】\t行气止痛，温中止呕，纳气平喘。用于胸腹胀闷疼痛，胃寒呕吐呃逆，肾虚气逆喘急。\n【附注】\t土沉香 (Aquilaria sinensis) 已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种可进行贸易，但须受许可证制度管制。"}]},{"ID":"20240206113401-2wrpev3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206113401-2wrpev3","updated":"20240206113401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206113401-zo4mn8z.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205161951-bsn4beh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205161951-bsn4beh","updated":"20240205161951"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沉香"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沉香-20240205161951-6846fqk.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716084130-mvth3ji","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716084130-mvth3ji","updated":"20240716084138"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 561px;","style":"width: 551px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沉香 (18)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沉香 18-20240716084130-qadakno.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 551px;\" parent-style=\"width: 561px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 565px;","style":"width: 555px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沉香 (17)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沉香 17-20240716084138-aiqojj5.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 555px;\" parent-style=\"width: 565px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240716083735-uxpj96e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240716083735-uxpj96e","updated":"20240716083735"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 386px;","style":"width: 376px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"沉香 (14)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/沉香 14-20240716083440-f32q9kn.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 376px;\" parent-style=\"width: 386px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":